---
description: Contribution procedure
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow AGENTS.md. Hard stops:

- If `git status --porcelain` is not empty, or this branch was not just created from fetched `origin/main`, stop.
- If an open pull request already changes the same files, stop and link it.
- Do not push to `origin`. Open with `gh pr create --repo Droid-Deck/DroidDeck --head <fork-owner>:<branch> --base main`.
- Commit only the fix. No notes, images, logs, or extra agent instruction files.
- Run `python tools/check_conventions.py --base origin/main --title "..." --body <file>` and require it to pass before `gh pr create`.
